# RIMSHIRE: a seam is worked out after paying ten times.
game rimshire
cheat war 4
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat at 0 4 2
cheat turn 0
press RIGHT
press A
waituntil moves_used == 1 60
press RIGHT
press A
waituntil turn == 1 60
